# Play test of The Abyss (CIPlay the_abyss, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the expedition's raft
# over the trench's east edge (its deck 0.13 m above the sea, x 14-23, z -8.75 to -1.25), the air line's valve at its
# west edge; the air pockets down the trench - the container on the shelf (12 m down), the gas tank on the ledge
# (18 m), the shack on the floor (42 m) - and the lair on the floor. The quest has 26 steps (ABYSS 10-26: seven new ones first - the shore camp, Black Peak, Wreck Cove, the compressor): the raft, the dive, the
# lair, the way back up; its pages steps are the journal's pages (the log, the chests' tags, the valve, the angler).
island The Abyss
offset -1.2308 0.0529
expect step 0
expect title The Bottom of the Abyss

# ABYSS 10-26: the shore camp first - Calder's last note, the compressor short of its gauge and piston
zone shorecamp
expect step 1
read Dr. Ruth Calder's field note
expect step 2
use compressor
expect message no gauge and no piston
# Black Peak: the trail to the signal mast, the gauge in its deck box
zone peakfoot
zone peaktop
expect step 3
open Mast deck box
expect story gauge 1
expect step 4
# Wreck Cove: the dive to the supply boat, breath at the cove's air pocket, the piston in its locker
zone wreckcove
air coveair
open Supply boat locker
expect story piston 1
expect step 5
# The compressor runs: the deep-dive chest
use compressor
expect story compressed 1
expect step 6
expect shown compchest
open Compressor chest
read Dive chief's card
expect step 7

# Onto the expedition's raft: the leader's log on the table
walk 22 -5 to 18 -5 to 16 -6.5 h=0.2
zone camp
expect step 8
read Expedition leader's log
wait 1
expect step 10

# The air line's valve is rusted fast without the wrench; the air pockets are empty
use airvalve
expect message rusted fast
expect hidden airpockets

# The wrench from the camp chest turns it: the pockets fill
open Camp chest
expect story abysswrench 1
wait 1
expect step 13
use airvalve
expect message wrench bites
expect story abysswrench 0
expect shown airpockets
wait 1
expect step 14

# The dive: breath at each pocket on the way down - the container on the shelf, the gas tank on the ledge, the shack
# on the floor
air pocket1
expect step 15
air pocket2
expect step 16
air pocket3

# The lair: the Abyssal Angler (its journal page) and its brood, the hoard
zone lair
expect step 18
expect message not a fish's
kill Angler fish
wait 1
expect step 20
open Lair hoard
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_HeadLight_Advanced 1
wait 1

# The way back up through the pockets to the raft (one step since R1b) - and the leader's log once more. (The raft may
# be counted already from boarding it twice at the start, so no exact step before it.)
zone pocket3
zone pocket2
zone pocket1
zone camp
expect step 25
read Expedition leader's log
expect done

# After the quest (their pages would count towards the quest's journal steps early):
# Secrets: the dive tags (a set), the flare posts (puzzle lights) and the expedition's cache, the lava tube, the
# stack run
use Dive tag 1
use Dive tag 2
use Dive tag 3
use Dive tag 4
use Dive tag 5
wait 1
expect message All five dive tags
expect item TitaniumIngot 1
expect hidden expcache
use Flare post 1
use Flare post 2
use Flare post 3
use Flare post 4
wait 1
expect shown expcache
open Expedition's cache
zone lavatube
open Lava tube chest
zone jump_ab_finale
open Stack run prize
